roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":129780986,"text":"Agh, I must think of something...","nextNodeIds":[210310102]},{"nodeId":210310102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3995649738,"text":"What's the matter?","nextNodeIds":[210310103]},{"nodeId":210310103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":863453130,"text":"Ah, it's you. *sigh* I'd rather not talk about it.","nextNodeIds":[210310104]},{"nodeId":210310104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":2649817090,"text":"Lately, business at the inn has been getting better and better, and we've had more people coming to stay.","nextNodeIds":[210310105]},{"nodeId":210310105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":2574487434,"text":"Some people are looking for a peaceful time alone, while others bring their families over on trips.","nextNodeIds":[210310106]},{"nodeId":210310106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":1583929682,"text":"The booming business is a good thing, of course, but the fact remains that many monsters roam the nearby areas.","nextNodeIds":[210310107]},{"nodeId":210310107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":285802786,"text":"If some child out at play or senior folk out on a stroll were to run into those creatures...","nextNodeIds":[210310108]},{"nodeId":210310108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":3643827290,"text":"To prevent such incidents from occurring, I have to go out and chase monsters around the inn away.","nextNodeIds":[210310109]},{"nodeId":210310109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":3369507098,"text":"But I am just one man, and they are many...","nextNodeIds":[210310110]},{"nodeId":210310110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":3090138026,"text":"Traveler, could you lend me a hand? You will be well-paid, I assure you!","nextNodeIds":[210310111,210310112]},{"nodeId":210310111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":252482330,"text":"Leave it to me.","nextNodeIds":[210310115]},{"nodeId":210310115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":4151478386,"text":"I'm counting on you, in any case. I noticed that there were various monster encampments about with dangerous creatures within them.","nextNodeIds":[210310116]},{"nodeId":210310116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":206173378,"text":"Also, another group of monsters tiptoed up near the inn and even set up camp there...","nextNodeIds":[210310117]},{"nodeId":210310117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":503529202,"text":"Ugh...","nextNodeIds":[210310118]},{"nodeId":210310118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":3646785386,"text":"You know what? You can leave the more dangerous ones to me. Just help me to clear out the monsters surrounding the inn.","nextNodeIds":[210310119]},{"nodeId":210310119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":2490936762,"text":"We'll meet up back here once all the monsters have been driven out.","nextNodeIds":[210310120]},{"nodeId":210310120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":2154466610,"text":"*sigh* These monsters really are a problem...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":210310112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3873816178,"text":"I mean, you're pretty good yourself, aren't you?","nextNodeIds":[210310113]},{"nodeId":210310113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":1669023458,"text":"Me? Well... Thank you for the praise, but I'm just passable.","nextNodeIds":[210310114]},{"nodeId":210310114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2202,"speakerName":"Huai'an","textMapHash":2894419810,"text":"And even so, I cannot fight them all by myself.","nextNodeIds":[210310115]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2103101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2202"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2103102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Go to the monster camp and defeat them","stepDescTextMapHash":960832356,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2103102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q2103102","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2103102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133104817"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","